<title>USA: Clackamas Cty Hosp, Ore., yields 6.40 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Clackamas Cty Hosp, Ore., yields 6.40 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $11.5 million of Clackamas County Hospital Facility Authority, Ore., revenue bonds, Series 1996, for the Robinson Jewish Home, Rose Schnitzer Living Center Project, with a top yield of 6.40 percent in 2028. The preliminary pricing follows.</p>
</text>
